    },
    {
      "id": "DEFECT-2",
      "location": "benchmarks/runner/roundtrip_accuracy.cpp",
      "issue": "BM_RoundtripAccuracy_T81Cell evaluated if (Cell::from_int(val).to_int() == val) inside the timed loop without DoNotOptimize barriers on the input int64_t, intermediate Cell, or output int64_t, mixing oracle branching into timing and permitting constexpr folding across from_int().to_int().",
      "repair": "Moved oracle accuracy verification to the untimed setup_and_prevalidate_roundtrip() phase and added BM_CellRoundtrip_T81Cell (and updated BM_RoundtripAccuracy_T81Cell) with explicit DoNotOptimize(val), DoNotOptimize(cell), DoNotOptimize(roundtrip), and ClobberMemory() barriers."
    },
    {
      "id": "DEFECT-3",
      "location": "benchmarks/runner/benchmark_runner.cpp",
      "issue": "CustomReporter::ReportRuns overwrote final_results[family] on each RT_Iteration run, discarding earlier repetitions and reporting only the final repetition instead of retaining all repetitions and reporting the median and spread.",
      "repair": "Stored all per-repetition throughput and latency values in BenchmarkResult vectors, computed median throughput and latency across repetitions via ComputeMedian(), and added per-repetition raw/median/min/max/range/stddev/CV reporting."
    },
    {
      "id": "DEFECT-4",
      "location": "benchmarks/runner/arith_throughput.cpp, benchmarks/runner/benchmark_runner.cpp",
